# ==============================================================================
# VitaWise Netlify Redirects & Edge Reverse-Proxy Rules
# ==============================================================================
# 1. API Reverse-Proxy Rule
# Requests to /api/* are proxied to the existing backend hosting URL.
# Replace 'https://your-backend-api-url.example.com' with your actual production backend URL.
/api/*  https://your-backend-api-url.example.com/api/:splat  200!

# 2. Multi-Page Entry Point Clean URLs
/login            /login.html            200
/signup           /signup.html           200
/onboarding       /onboarding.html       200
/profile          /profile.html          200
/forgot-password  /forgot-password.html  200

# 3. Single-Page Application (SPA) Deep-Link Fallback Rule
# Any unmatched route serves the main application shell
/*                /index.html            200
